column1:
Placeholders: {{order_id}}, {{customer_firstname}}, {{customer_lastname}},
{{grand_total}}, {{store_name}}, {{status}}, {{tracking_number}}, {{carrier}}. A line with {{tracking_number}}
or {{carrier}} is left out when the shipment has no tracking number.

